# WebSocket Protocol

## Connection
Connect to `ws://<host>/ws?token=<jwt>`

## Client Messages
```json
{"type": "subscribe", "channels": ["feed", "tasks"]}
{"type": "unsubscribe", "channels": ["feed"]}
```

## Server Messages
All server messages include a `channel` field:
```json
{"channel": "tasks", "task_id": "...", "status": "completed"}
{"channel": "agents", "agent_id": "...", "status": "working"}
{"channel": "feed", "id": "...", "content": "...", "item_type": "task_completed"}
{"channel": "sessions", "session_id": "...", "message": "...", "sender_role": "assistant"}
{"channel": "pipelines", "pipeline_id": "...", "run_id": "...", "current_stage": 2}
```

## Reconnection
Exponential backoff: 1s, 2s, 4s, 8s, max 30s.
